{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"CLSA-2026-1793021252","published":"2026-10-26T13:27:44Z","modified":"2026-11-20T10:28:33.866818714Z","upstream":["CVE-2024-0397","CVE-2025-15366","CVE-2025-15367","CVE-2025-8194"],"summary":"Fix CVE(s): CVE-2024-0397, CVE-2025-8194","details":"   * SECURITY UPDATE: infinite loop in tarfile on archives with negative\n     member offsets\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2025-8194.patch: reject negative byte counts in\n       TarInfo._block() in Lib/tarfile.py, add regression tests\n     - CVE-2025-8194\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: race condition in ssl.SSLContext.cert_store_stats()\n     and get_ca_certs() walking the X509_STORE without its lock\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2024-0397.patch: take a locked deep copy of the\n       store objects via an X509_STORE_get1_objects() shim in\n       Modules/_ssl.c\n     - CVE-2024-0397\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: IMAP command injection through CR/LF in command\n     arguments\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2025-15366.patch: reject NUL, CR and LF in\n       IMAP4._command() arguments in Lib/imaplib.py (other control\n       characters stay allowed and are sent quoted), add regression test\n     - CVE-2025-15366\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: POP3 command injection through control characters in\n     commands\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2025-15367.patch: reject control characters in\n       POP3._putcmd() in Lib/poplib.py, add regression test\n     - CVE-2025-15367","affected":[{"package":{"name":"idle-python2.7","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:10","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/idle-python2.7?distro=debian-10"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2.7.16-2+deb10u4+tuxcare.els9"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian10els/CLSA-2026-1793021252.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libpython2.7","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:10","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libpython2.7?distro=debian-10"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2.7.